# NEPSE AI Frontend

React + Vite + Tailwind CSS frontend for NEPSE AI Signal & Alert System

## Environment Variables

Create `.env.local`:

```
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000/api
```

## Development

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```

Frontend runs on `http://localhost:5173`

## Build

```bash
npm run build
npm run preview
```
